msgid "Migrate data types"
msgstr ""

#: src/Controller/Admin/ThesaurusController.php:509
msgid ""
"The data type \"thesaurus\" is added to the resource templates and to the "
"configs that use the custom vocab of a thesaurus, so the concepts can be "
"selected in a tree. The custom vocabs are not removed and the existing "
"values are not modified."
msgstr ""

#: src/Controller/Admin/ThesaurusController.php:513
#: src/Controller/Admin/ThesaurusController.php:515
msgid "Convert items into concepts"
msgstr ""

#: src/Controller/Admin/ThesaurusController.php:514
msgid ""
"The items that belong to a thesaurus are converted into concepts, that are a "
"dedicated resource type since version 3.4.26. The ids and the values are "
"kept, so the links to the concepts remain valid, but the items are removed "
"from the browse of the items. The items with a media cannot be converted. "
"The assignments to item sets and sites, the data of the other modules and "
"the data types of the values are saved in the database before any change, so "
"the conversion can be reverted with the task \"Convert concepts into "
"items\". Without backup, the thesaurus is not converted."
msgstr ""

#: src/Controller/Admin/ThesaurusController.php:519
#: src/Controller/Admin/ThesaurusController.php:521
msgid "Convert concepts into items"
msgstr ""

#: src/Controller/Admin/ThesaurusController.php:520
msgid ""
"The concepts of a thesaurus are converted back into items, in order to "
"rollback a conversion. The ids and the values are kept, so the links remain "
"valid, and the structure remains available via the skos values, so the "
"thesaurus can be converted again. The assignments to item sets and sites, "
"the data of the other modules and the data types of the values are restored "
"from the backup saved by the conversion. Warning: the rollback may be "
"incomplete when this backup is missing, when the resources changed since the "
"conversion, or when the data were saved by an older version, and the data "
"type of the thesaurus added manually to a template since the conversion is "
"removed too, so a backup of the database remains recommended."
msgstr ""

#: src/Controller/Admin/ThesaurusController.php:526
#: src/Controller/Admin/ThesaurusController.php:528
msgid "Fix the data of the concepts"
msgstr ""

#: src/Controller/Admin/ThesaurusController.php:527
msgid ""
"The values filled with a concept via a custom vocab use the data type of the "
"thesaurus, the template properties allow it, and the rows that reference a "
"concept as an item (item sets, sites, data of other modules) are removed, "
"like when an item is deleted."
msgstr ""

